{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"elm","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Elm","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Elm (.elm).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"elm","name":"Elm","extensions":[".elm"],"grammar":"grammars/elm.json","lineComment":"--","blockComment":["{-","-}"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Elm","path":"snippets/elm.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/elm.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\{\\\\-\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\-\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\-\\\\-.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\|>|<\\\\||->|<-|::|\\\\+\\\\+|\\\\.\\\\.\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:exposing|import|module|alias|where|case|else|port|then|type|let|as|if|in|of)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Nothing|False|True|Just|Err|Ok)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Attribute|String|Result|Float|Maybe|Model|Never|Order|Bool|Char|List|Html|Int|Cmd|Sub|Msg)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:String\\\\.fromInt|Html\\\\.text|Html\\\\.div|filter|foldl|foldr|map)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/elm.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module ${1:Main} exposing (${2:main})\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} : ${2:Int} -> ${3:Int}\",\n      \"${1:name} ${4:x} =\",\n      \"    $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function with a type\"\n  },\n  \"Type\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"type\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type ${1:Msg}\",\n      \"    = ${2:Increment}\",\n      \"    | ${3:Decrement}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A custom type\"\n  },\n  \"Case\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"case\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"case ${1:value} of\",\n      \"    ${2:pattern} ->\",\n      \"        $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A case\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Elm\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Elm.\n\n## Files\n\n`.elm`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `--`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `mod` | A module |\n| `fn` | A function with a type |\n| `type` | A custom type |\n| `case` | A case |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}